data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A&#39;\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A&#39;\\)</span> (axioms of a same-language extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;\\cup\\{\\gamma\\},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\">\\(H\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;\\cup\\{\\gamma\\},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\)</span> (formal system obtained by adjoining <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(H)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}incompletable}\\vdash\n\\forall A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\forall H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A&#39;\\land\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\land\nH=(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;\\cup\\{\\gamma\\},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\n\\mathrm{Elem}(H)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(H)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(H\\nvdash\\varphi&#39;\\land H\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi&#39;)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}incompletable}\\vdash\n\\forall A&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\forall H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A&#39;\\land\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\land\nH=(\\Sigma_G,A&#39;\\cup\\{\\gamma\\},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\n\\mathrm{Elem}(H)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(H)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(H\\nvdash\\varphi&#39;\\land H\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi&#39;)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>即使添加Gödel句子，只要所得扩展仍相容且有效，它仍不完备</li>\n<li>形式系统是三元组，不能写成集合并<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\\cup\\{\\gamma\\}\">\\(G&#39;\\cup\\{\\gamma\\}\\)</span>；这里明确只把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>加入公理分量</li>\n<li>本质不完备性保证新系统仍有某个独立句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi&#39;\">\\(\\varphi&#39;\\)</span>；若要称它为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>自己的规范Gödel句，还需相对于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>重新建立编码和可证性谓词</li>\n<li>添加不完备性句子不能解决问题</li>\n<li>不完备性是本质的，不可&quot;修复&quot;</li>\n<li>这是不完备性定理的深刻意义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"38545b094b915076","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"H\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,A'\\cup\\{\\gamma\\},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}incompletable}\\vdash\n\\forall A'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\forall H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\subseteq A'\\land\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\land\nH=(\\Sigma_G,A'\\cup\\{\\gamma\\},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\n\\mathrm{Elem}(H)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(H)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi'\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(H\\nvdash\\varphi'\\land H\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi')\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"G'\\cup\\{\\gamma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi'","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1878,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","38545b094b915076","c7befd96bd551ade","360e00ddf38f0f16","b823f18a7fc28400","35c764f4e9f21f28","5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","16613851c4bce386","906680bfce5f44c0"]}